+# Audit command ledger
+
+All paths below are the paths used during this audit. Read-only inputs remained under
+`/reference`, `/candidate`, and `/audit-input.json`; scratch regeneration used
+`/tmp/audit-work`.
+
+## Integrity and inventory
+
+```sh
